  "title": {
   "en": "Eiyuu Onna Kishi ni Yuunou to Bareta Ore no Bijin Harem Kishidan - Gaikaku Hikume no Kijutsu Kishidan"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "英雄女騎士に有能とバレた俺の美人ハーレム騎士団　ガイカク・ヒクメの奇術騎士団"
   },
   {
    "en": "I was Found to be Competent by a Heroic Female Knight and Lead a Beautiful Harem of Knights"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Gaikaku, a genius mage with unparalleled magical prowess, lives in quiet seclusion under the employ of a gluttonous regional lord, Borick. While earning pocket change through secretive assignments, he devotes himself freely to magical research, surrounded by a diverse group of girls from various races. However, after taking down a certain elite elf, his incredible talents as a mage begin to draw attention across the land...?!\n___\n**Links:**\n- Alternative Official Raw - [Niconico](https://manga.nicovideo.jp/comic/70163)",
   "ja": "天才魔導士ガイカクは、類稀な魔導技術を持ちながら\n肥え太った地方領主・ボリックの元で秘匿任務請負人として小銭稼ぎをしつつ、\nたくさんの種族の少女を従えて、ひっそりと自由に魔導研究に没頭していた。\nしかし、とあるエリートエルフの討伐をきっかけに\nその天才魔導士としての実力が徐々に知れ渡っていってしまい……！？\n\n戦術最強×魔導技術×騎士団\nハーレムファンタジーコミカライズ、開幕!"
  },
